<h2>Notes</h2>
<ul class="doc-body">
<li><strong>Door hardware</strong> &mdash; hinges/latches are the parts missing from the queue.
They come in L/R versions, and most exist twice under different export names
(<code>__1_</code> vs <code>__1___1_</code>). Geometry-matched into one row each.</li>
<li><strong>Wheel kit</strong> &mdash; the support/foot (<code>Foot__1___1_.stl</code>, 292 cm&sup3;)
and tire (<code>Gomma.stl</code>, 85 cm&sup3;) were never imported, which is why the kit
has no support structure. <code>Cerchio</code> / <code>Wheel</code> are the same 47 mm half-wheel.</li>
<li><strong>Weights</strong> are PLA at 1.24 g/cm&sup3; &mdash; recalculate for other materials.</li>
<li><strong>Regenerate</strong>: <code>python3 hdry_work/worksheet_data.py</code> then rebuild this page.</li>
</ul>
